01:37:19.110 --> 01:37:20.990
It was only 10% worse.

01:37:20.990 --> 01:37:24.890
So that's something that we
would probably tolerate because

01:37:24.890 --> 01:37:27.980
of how much nicer it looks.

01:37:27.980 --> 01:37:29.780
And so that's an
excellent point.

01:37:29.780 --> 01:37:31.680
And there's wiggle room there.

01:37:31.680 --> 01:37:34.400
You don't have to be the
most efficient or the top.

01:37:34.400 --> 01:37:37.190
You just you want
to find the balance.

01:37:37.190 --> 01:37:39.350
Yeah.

